    "Wildlife Phase 0 (docs/wildlife-0/README.md): which animals live in each world, when, where and in what groups.",
    "species = what an animal is (taxa for GBIF, kind, water, flight style, size); casts = which world has it and its curated",
    "season, habitats, activity and group words. Tools/wildlife/fetch_gbif.py pulls CC0 / CC BY 4.0 GBIF records for every",
    "cast entry in its world's box (eBird left out, Bean Nov 24 2026); build_tables.py turns them into",
    "Content/TerrainData/<World>.wildlife.json; test_wildlife.py holds the realism rules.",
    "months: 'M-N' ranges (wrapping past December), comma separated. rare_months: outside the season, a trickle (weight <= 0.1).",
    "group.range: [typical, 9 in 10 stay under], used when the records hold fewer than build_tables' MIN_COUNTS counts.",
    "size_m: typical adult wingspan (birds), length (fish, sharks, turtles, mammals) or disc width (rays); check in Phase 1."
